WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Take a cleanup sign-up on the phone.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.167
Cleanup sign-ups. Phone sign-ups are taken here.

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:12.933
Take a phone sign-up. On the season's card. The tour opens the Spring one.

00:00:13.433 --> 00:00:18.800
Who is calling. Name, phone and email. Name and phone are required.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:27.600
Where and when. The service address and town, and their preferred date or time frame (a range, now, a month, no preference).

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:33.900
What they want. Tick the services from your form; Other is for anything not on the list.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:41.067
Estimate style. Meet a manager (an estimate visit is booked) or just send a quote (a stop-by to quote).

00:00:41.567 --> 00:00:49.400
Auto-pay call. Spring form: would they like a call about auto-pay? Yes turns into a separate call for the office.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:57.367
Billing changes and notes. A separate billing address or new contact details, and anything else they mention.

00:00:57.867 --> 00:01:04.300
Add to the list. Adds them in line with their number, like the online form. The tour doesn't save.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:09.267
Close the form. The x (or Cancel) closes it without saving.

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:19.567
Work the list from #1. Accept books the estimate visit or the stop-by quote; the x dismisses. Requests are handled in the order received.

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:25.667
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
